nt-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_7dd92062-c035-4bf7-9f88-f58ba5821ffb" contextRef="C_a005ee62-e52a-4552-a42e-48e8628992ca" name="us-gaap:UnrecordedUnconditionalPurchaseObligationMaximumQuantity" unitRef="U_pure" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">two</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> PSVs. In addition, during the second quarter of 2025, $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ca439b43-7e00-4c54-b8bb-36b88c1243a3" contextRef="C_3d217b5d-9afc-482a-b42a-462b21136e37" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfProductiveAssets" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.8</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million of the proceeds from the sale of </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_d52eefa7-5a6b-4da1-b4a3-e66639e8afc1" contextRef="C_3d217b5d-9afc-482a-b42a-462b21136e37" name="smhi:NumberOfEquipmentSold" unitRef="U_Vessel" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">one</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> FSV and $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_58b57e37-60a8-461c-b9d0-e2765e303b15" contextRef="C_d2b70a15-d3c8-4ab6-a442-2a6b47409db5" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfProductiveAssets" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" dec